</p>
<h3 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-ParentNodes">Parent Nodes</h3>
<p>Parent nodes are navigation items at the first level and is always visib=
le.</p>
<p>All the parent menu options require an icon and come in a few variations=
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h4 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-ParentModulewithnochildren"><strong>Paren=
t Module with no children</strong></h4>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail" drag=
gable=3D"false" height=3D"37" src=3D"b172d26876d171ade50f5efb5d61795baed140=
1729c5a328670105bca9dfdd20" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1020473=
507/Parent%20Module.png?version=3D2&amp;modificationDate=3D1733410817378&am=
p;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"=
2048974281" data-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D=
"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Parent Module.png" data-=
base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image=
/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1020473507" data-linked-resource=
-container-version=3D"10" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"294"></span></p>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li>Parent modules require an icon</li>
</ul>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h4 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-ParentModulewithnestedoptions"><strong>Pa=
rent Module with nested options</strong></h4>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail" drag=
gable=3D"false" height=3D"37" src=3D"3a91d99f2be554d5d7d385f90b151689b45604=
d6e9ac94f6e95c46b91330831e" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1020473=
507/Parent%20Module%20with%20Children.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1731010472048&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"2048974373" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-link=
ed-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Paren=
t Module with Children.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-link=
ed-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D=
"1020473507" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" tabindex=3D"0" a=
lt=3D"" width=3D"294"></span></p>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li>Make it expandable if there is one or more children modules</li>
 <li>Only parent nodes can have children ( 2 levels only )</li>
</ul>
<h5 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-ParentModuleChildTypes">Parent Module Chi=
ld Types</h5>
<ul>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#0055cc;"><em>Module Child <strong>Alternatives</=
strong> Mode</em></span> - With this mode, all the children are alternative=
s to the parent.
  <ul>
   <li>All alternatives should be child nodes, as parent node</li>
   <li>Current Implementation: <em>Parent node needs to be assigned for the=
 children to show.&nbsp;</em></li>
   <li>In the event that there is only one option it should make the parent=
 represent the only alternative.
    <ul>
     <li>This means when the only child is:
      <ul>
       <li>an external module, the parent is an external module</li>
       <li>an internal module, the parent gets the child's internal link</l=
i>
      </ul></li>
    </ul></li>
  </ul></li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#0055cc;"><em>Module Child <strong>Menu</strong> =
Mode</em></span> - With his mode, all the children are not alternatives to =
the parent.&nbsp;
  <ul>
   <li>No parent inheritance features</li>
   <li>If the user has access to a child node, but not the parent node, we =
need to show an empty parent node</li>
   <li>example
    <ul>
     <li><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" src=3D"10d86cd60a057453aab63816=
a6730addbff055a498d6fff646db6bf7ca56d98a" data-image-src=3D"/download/attac=
hments/1020473507/Screenshot%202025-09-18%20at%208.37.25%E2%80%AFAM.png?ver=
sion=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1758199073556&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved=
-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2401113450" data-linked-res=
ource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-re=
source-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2025-09-18 at 8.37.25=E2=80=AFAM.png" da=
ta-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"im=
age/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1020473507" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-version=3D"10" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"356" height=
=3D"892"></span></li>
    </ul></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h4 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-ExternalParentModule"><strong>External Pa=
rent Module</strong></h4>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail" drag=
gable=3D"false" height=3D"37" src=3D"6367facafafa103d17c20ab0483059c861d96a=
bff373f6cc84af0c2762be6b01" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1020473=
507/External%20Parent%20Module.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D17310=
10530255&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-reso=
urce-id=3D"2048974384" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resou=
rce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"External Pare=
nt Module.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-c=
