data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=
=3D"294"></span></p>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li>Modules flagged as external should show an undock/external icon the ri=
ght of all notes including parent nodes</li>
</ul>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h3 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-ChildNodes">Child Nodes</h3>
<p>Child notes refer to modules that are available within context of a pare=
nt and are hidden by default.</p>
<p>Child nodes never have icons to the left of the labels</p>
<p>The page titles for child notes are also nested.</p>
<p>For Example:</p>
<ul>
 <li>Order: Uploads</li>
 <li>Onboarding: Form-based</li>
</ul>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p><strong>Child Module</strong></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail" drag=
gable=3D"false" height=3D"74" src=3D"6cae272bf1bc4262f8b7047da291aa1661f203=
