</p>
<h2 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-Separators">Separators</h2>
<p>Provide the ability to add a separator between parent modules at any poi=
nt within the module menu list</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h2 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-SelectionBehaviour">Selection Behaviour</=
h2>
<p>All nodes except the separators should be selectable</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h3 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-Selectinganinternalmodule">Selecting an i=
nternal module</h3>
<p>Open that module and set that node as selected</p>
<p>Example:&nbsp;</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"399" width=3D"468" src=3D"25575b2438f6=
