wnload/attachments/1020473507/Screenshot%202024-12-05%20at%2010.53.05%E2%80=
%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1733414001630&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2076244612" da=
ta-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" d=
ata-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-12-05 at 10.53.05=E2=
=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1020473507" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span=
></p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h3 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-Selectinganexternalmodule">Selecting an e=
xternal module</h3>
<p>Selecting an external module should open that module in a new window but=
 not be selectable, the selection should remain on the node selected prior =
to selecting the external module</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h3 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-Selectingaparentnodewithaninternaldestina=
tion">Selecting a parent node with an internal destination</h3>
<p>Selecting any parent node should expand that node and collapse any other=
 open parents ( accordion pattern )</p>
<p>Selecting the node should also set that node as selected and open the mo=
dule</p>
<p>Example:</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"523" width=3D"468" src=3D"66cac7aee27b=
c77ce2ab319c91962a0b3b9880b8f02b2cd4bc1b425d58ef24e2" data-image-src=3D"/do=
wnload/attachments/1020473507/Screenshot%202024-12-05%20at%2010.57.58%E2%80=
%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1733414290428&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2076244722" da=
ta-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" d=
ata-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-12-05 at 10.57.58=E2=
=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1020473507" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span=
></p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h3 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-Selectingaparentnodewithoutadestination">=
Selecting a parent node without a destination</h3>
<p>Selecting any parent node should expand that node and collapse any other=
 open parents ( accordion pattern )</p>
<p>When selecting a parent with no destination and more than 2 children, se=
lect the first child that is an internal module.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Otherwise do nothing</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>Example:</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"287" width=3D"468" src=3D"e29ef80ce757=
0affb6c36267a9f83298d27e77209ab4a61fee08fb1c8688b1ae" data-image-src=3D"/do=
wnload/attachments/1020473507/Screenshot%202024-12-05%20at%2011.01.44%E2%80=
%AFAM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1733414519741&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2076244886" da=
ta-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" d=
ata-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2024-12-05 at 11.01.44=E2=
=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1020473507" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D""></span=
></p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<h2 id=3D"CompassModuleNavigation-NodePropertiesChecklist">Node Properties =
Checklist</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
 <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
